=== plain-80: width 80, height 24, profile notty, dark, glyphs ascii, plain
# play runall/pending ------------------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Play mode, mocks: the Run All screen proposed for slice 8,$
# each row's state from the control's real Check, each change$
# the real control's Plan, all of them in one plan on the real$
# plan/apply engine. Which controls hardn.yml asks for, how a$
# row is skipped, and the hostname asked whatever the risk are$
# the gallery's stand-ins, unit (b)'s to build. Nothing on this$
# machine changes: every command and file is the fake's.$
$
# Info: runall/pending$
# web-01.example.net runs Debian 13. debian13 a minute after an$
# SSH port change to 2230, not yet confirmed: every plan refuses$
# until hardn confirm.$
$
# Run All ######################################################$
$
  [+] User                 Configured Already as asked$
  [+] Firewall             Configured Already as asked$
  [ ] SSH Login            Partial Change pending$
  [+] SSH Auth             Configured Nothing asked$
  [ ] SSH Port             Partial Already as asked$
  [+] AppArmor             Configured Status only$
  [+] Auto Updates         Configured Already as asked$
  [ ] DNS                  Not Configured Change pending$
  [+] Backups              Configured Used, not changed$
  [ ] Environment          Not Configured Nothing asked$
$
  Select an option$
$
   1) Apply all            Change pending$
$
   0) Return$
$
  > Enter your choice [0-1 or q]: 1$
$
# Warning$
# A change is waiting for hardn confirm. Confirm it from a new$
# connection, or let it roll back, then try again.$
$
# Run All ######################################################$
$
  [+] User                 Configured Already as asked$
  [+] Firewall             Configured Already as asked$
  [ ] SSH Login            Partial Change pending$
  [+] SSH Auth             Configured Nothing asked$
  [ ] SSH Port             Partial Already as asked$
  [+] AppArmor             Configured Status only$
  [+] Auto Updates         Configured Already as asked$
  [ ] DNS                  Not Configured Change pending$
  [+] Backups              Configured Used, not changed$
  [ ] Environment          Not Configured Nothing asked$
$
  Select an option$
$
   1) Apply all            Change pending$
$
   0) Return$
$
  > Enter your choice [0-1 or q]: 0$
$
# simulated system ---------------------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Nothing was applied.$
$

